## Git

| Branch | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `main` | Production-ready / releases |
| `{{ default_integration_branch }}` | Integration (daily work) |
| `feat/*`, `fix/*`, `docs/*` | Short-lived local work |

- Conventional commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `chore:`, …  
- Prefer local feature branches; merge to integration with review  
- Never commit `.env` or credentials  

